        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8521SF, Twist Lever with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Santa Fe Lever with Rectangular Rose is a perfect marriage of hard and soft. The Square Twist Santa Fe Leverset loses its straight edge is a lovely twist that brings an element of the old world door lever. Made out of solid brass, it is available in several traditional door hardware finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from a dummy lever, passage lever, or a privacy lever function. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Santa Fe Leverset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Twisted Santa Fe Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Santa Fe Lever with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Santa Fe Lever with Rectangular Rose is a perfect marriage of hard and soft. The Square Twist Santa Fe Leverset loses its straight edge is a lovely twist that brings an element of the old world door lever. Made out of solid brass, it is available in several traditional door hardware finishes including oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from a dummy lever, passage lever, or a privacy lever function. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Twisted Santa Fe Leversets, Santa Fe Lever with Rectangular Roses, Emtek 8521SF, Emtek 8121SF, Emtek 8121SF, twist leversets, Twist Lever with Rectangular Roses, Santa Fe Leverset with Rectangular Roses, Twisted Santa Fe Leversets, square twist levers,"
